  "Set up automatically: the engine ships inside this app's installer and is extracted on first launch, then kept current from GitHub. Only change this to use your own build (the folder containing setup_windows.bat).": "自动配置：引擎随本应用的安装程序一起提供，首次启动时解压，之后从 GitHub 保持更新。只有在使用你自己的构建（包含 setup_windows.bat 的文件夹）时才需要更改。",
