  "Fetched automatically on first launch (from RHI's published package). One copy gets placed in each game's folder. Browse only if you want to supply your own copy from an NVIDIA driver.": "首次启动时自动获取（来自 RHI 发布的包）。每个游戏的文件夹里会放置一份副本。只有想使用来自 NVIDIA 驱动的自有副本时才需要浏览。",
  "Fetch automatically": "自动获取",
  "Streamline version": "Streamline 版本",
  "The streamline folder OptiScaler's DLSS-G Frame Gen needs is downloaded for you, so nvngx_dlssnr.dll above is the only file you have to supply yourself. \"Latest\" tracks the newest build RHI publishes; pick a specific one if a game misbehaves on the newest.": "OptiScaler 的 DLSS-G 帧生成所需的 streamline 文件夹会替你下载，因此上方的 nvngx_dlssnr.dll 是唯一需要你自己提供的文件。“最新”跟随 RHI 发布的最新构建；如果某个游戏在最新版上表现异常，请选择一个特定版本。",
