  "WARNING: REFramework is missing ({error}) -- OptiScaler will not run on this game until it is there.": "警告：缺少 REFramework（{error}）-- 在它就位之前 OptiScaler 不会在此游戏上运行。",
  "Set REFramework’s menu key to Insert (it had drifted to Numpad0, unreachable on a laptop) and enlarged its overlay text.": "已把 REFramework 的菜单键设为 Insert（它漂移到了笔记本上按不到的 Numpad0），并放大了其覆盖层文字。",
  "Next: open Edit and deploy Luma UE -- OptiScaler has no DLSS call to hook in this game until Luma supplies one.": "下一步：打开“编辑”并部署 Luma UE -- 在 Luma 提供 DLSS 调用之前，OptiScaler 在此游戏中没有可挂钩的东西。",
