  "Not in this game's folder yet -- download dlssnr_on_amd_setup.exe from the release page and put it beside the game exe.": "尚未在此游戏文件夹中 -- 请从发布页面下载 dlssnr_on_amd_setup.exe，放到游戏 exe 旁边。",
