  "Neural Rendering is switched off": "Neural Rendering 已关闭",
  "Feeder shader missing": "缺少 Feeder 着色器",
  "Select DLSS in Luma's overlay (Home)": "在 Luma 覆盖层（Home）中选择 DLSS",
  "Crashed with Luma UE": "使用 Luma UE 时崩溃",
  "Crashed with the Feeder": "使用 Feeder 时崩溃",
  "Crashed -- no known fix": "崩溃 -- 无已知修复",
  "The Feeder gave up": "Feeder 已放弃",
  "Fix did not help -- no known fix": "修复无效 -- 无已知修复",
  "Not working -- no known fix": "无法工作 -- 无已知修复",
  "NVIDIA Frame Generation multiplier": "NVIDIA 帧生成倍率",
  "The game's own DLSS Frame Generation -- how many frames it makes per rendered frame. Turn Frame Generation on in the game's video settings as usual; this only changes the multiplier it asks for. 3x and 4x need an RTX 50 series -- other cards stay at 2x. Also adjustable live from the Insert panel.": "游戏自带的 DLSS 帧生成 -- 每渲染一帧生成多少帧。照常在游戏的视频设置中开启帧生成；这里只改变它请求的倍率。3x 和 4x 需要 RTX 50 系列 -- 其他显卡保持 2x。也可在 Insert 面板中实时调整。",
  "Game setting": "游戏设置",
  "Dynamic (driver picks, RTX 50)": "动态（由驱动决定，RTX 50）",
  "Set by this app: Dynamic (driver picks the multiplier).": "由本应用设置：动态（驱动选择倍率）。",
  "Set by this app: {mult}x.": "由本应用设置：{mult}x。",
  "Applied once OptiScaler is installed.": "安装 OptiScaler 后生效。",
  "Currently Dynamic, set from the in-game panel. Pick a value here to manage it from the app.": "当前为动态，在游戏内面板中设置。在此选择一个值即可从应用管理。",
  "Currently {mult}x, set from the in-game panel. Pick a value here to manage it from the app.": "当前为 {mult}x，在游戏内面板中设置。在此选择一个值即可从应用管理。",
  "Game setting -- the game's own Frame Generation menu decides.": "游戏设置 -- 由游戏自带的帧生成菜单决定。",
  "Could not set the multiplier: {error}": "无法设置倍率：{error}",
  "Frame Generation multiplier back to the game's own setting.": "帧生成倍率已恢复为游戏自身设置。",
  "Saved -- applied once OptiScaler is installed for this game.": "已保存 -- 为此游戏安装 OptiScaler 后生效。",
  "Frame Generation multiplier applied. It takes effect on the next launch (or right away from the Insert panel).": "帧生成倍率已应用。下次启动时生效（或通过 Insert 面板立即生效）。",
  "OptiScaler build for this game": "此游戏使用的 OptiScaler 构建",
  "Pre-SR Neural Rendering": "超分前神经渲染（Pre-SR）",
  "Run NR before DLSS upscaling (faster)": "在 DLSS 超分之前运行 NR（更快）",
