  "Downloading {engine} {tag}…": "正在下载 {engine} {tag}…",
  "Settings default ({engine})": "设置中的默认值（{engine}）",
  "Installed with {installed}; press Install on the card to switch it to {engine}.": "已用 {installed} 安装；在卡片上按“安装”即可切换到 {engine}。",
