  "Fetching RTXMFG and checking its checksum…": "正在下载 RTXMFG 并核对校验和…",
  "RTXMFG installed as {file}. Launch the game, turn Frame Generation on, press Backspace.": "RTXMFG 已安装为 {file}。启动游戏，开启帧生成，按 Backspace。",
