    "NVIDIA App > 图形 > 此游戏 > DLSS 覆盖：关闭",
  "Check the game's own settings ask for DLSS": "检查游戏自身设置是否选择了 DLSS",
  "Installed. No splash or menu appears in the game on this route -- Game Help shows how to reach it.": "已安装。此方式下游戏中不会出现标志或菜单 -- 游戏帮助会说明如何打开。",
  "Game": "游戏",
  "DLSS 5": "DLSS 5",
  "Frame Generation": "帧生成",
  "Advanced": "高级",
  "Show advanced options": "显示高级选项",
  "DLSS 5 + Luma": "DLSS 5 + Luma",
  "No DLSS of its own. Luma's Prey mod adds real DLSS with the game's own motion vectors and depth, which gives OptiScaler a DLSS call to hook. Install sets up OptiScaler and Luma (after you confirm Luma's licence) and switches DLSS on in Luma for you.": "游戏本身没有 DLSS。Luma 的 Prey 模组利用游戏自身的运动矢量和深度加入真正的 DLSS，从而为 OptiScaler 提供可挂钩的 DLSS 调用。“安装”会配置 OptiScaler 和 Luma（在你确认 Luma 许可证之后），并自动在 Luma 中开启 DLSS。",
  "Deploy Luma": "部署 Luma",
  "Luma (adds DLSS to this game)": "Luma（为此游戏加入 DLSS）",
  "This game gets its DLSS call from Luma. Download and set up Luma now?": "此游戏的 DLSS 调用来自 Luma。现在下载并设置 Luma 吗？",
  "Luma's Prey mod adds real DLSS with the game's own motion vectors, the reason it beats the Feeder here. Not yet run with this app. The app switches DLSS on in Luma for you.": "Luma 的 Prey 模组利用游戏自身的运动矢量加入真正的 DLSS，因此在这里优于 Feeder。尚未在本应用中实际运行过。应用会自动在 Luma 中开启 DLSS。",
  "This game's own DLSS ({version}) is too old for Neural Rendering. Luma-Framework's mod for it adds real DLSS with the game's own motion vectors, which gives OptiScaler a DLSS call to hook. Install sets up OptiScaler and Luma (after you confirm Luma's licence). Luma needs DirectX 11: pick it in the game's settings and turn the game's own DLSS off. The app switches DLSS on in Luma for you.": "此游戏自身的 DLSS（{version}）对 Neural Rendering 来说太旧。Luma-Framework 为此游戏提供的模组利用游戏自身的运动矢量加入真正的 DLSS，为 OptiScaler 提供 DLSS 调用。“安装”会配置 OptiScaler 和 Luma（在你确认 Luma 许可证之后）。Luma 需要 DirectX 11：在游戏设置中选择它，关闭游戏自身的 DLSS。应用会自动在 Luma 中开启 DLSS。",
  "No DLSS of its own. Luma-Framework's mod for it adds real DLSS with the game's own motion vectors, which gives OptiScaler a DLSS call to hook. Install sets up OptiScaler and Luma (after you confirm Luma's licence). Luma needs DirectX 11: pick it in the game's settings and turn the game's own DLSS off. The app switches DLSS on in Luma for you.": "游戏本身没有 DLSS。Luma-Framework 为此游戏提供的模组利用游戏自身的运动矢量加入真正的 DLSS，为 OptiScaler 提供 DLSS 调用。“安装”会配置 OptiScaler 和 Luma（在你确认 Luma 许可证之后）。Luma 需要 DirectX 11：在游戏设置中选择它，关闭游戏自身的 DLSS。应用会自动在 Luma 中开启 DLSS。",
  "The DLSS5 Feeder deployed here is doing the job, but Luma-Framework has a mod for this game that adds real DLSS with the game's own motion vectors -- better than the Feeder's estimate. Game Help switches it over.": "这里部署的 DLSS5 Feeder 正在工作，但 Luma-Framework 有此游戏的模组，能利用游戏自身的运动矢量加入真正的 DLSS，比 Feeder 的估算更好。游戏帮助可帮你切换。",
  "Luma-Framework has a mod for this game that adds real DLSS with the game's own motion vectors. Luma runs on DirectX 11: pick DirectX 11 in the game's settings if it offers DX12, and turn the game's own DLSS off. The app switches DLSS on in Luma for you.": "Luma-Framework 有此游戏的模组，能利用游戏自身的运动矢量加入真正的 DLSS。Luma 运行于 DirectX 11：如果游戏提供 DX12，请在设置中选择 DirectX 11，并关闭游戏自身的 DLSS。应用会自动在 Luma 中开启 DLSS。",
  "The DLSS5 Feeder is running this game, but Luma-Framework has a mod for it that adds real DLSS with the game's own motion vectors -- sharper in motion than the Feeder's estimate. Switching removes the Feeder and sets up Luma (after you confirm its licence). Luma runs on DirectX 11.": "DLSS5 Feeder 正在运行此游戏，但 Luma-Framework 有模组能利用游戏自身的运动矢量加入真正的 DLSS，运动中比 Feeder 的估算更清晰。切换会移除 Feeder 并设置 Luma（在确认其许可证之后）。Luma 运行于 DirectX 11。",
  "Luma is set up here, but the game last ran on DirectX 12, where Luma does not load. Switch the game to DirectX 11 in its own graphics settings, then launch again.": "此处已设置 Luma，但游戏上次以 DirectX 12 运行，Luma 在 DX12 下不会加载。请在游戏图形设置中切换到 DirectX 11，然后重新启动。",
  "This game gets its DLSS call from Luma, which is not set up yet. Fix it sets up OptiScaler and Luma together (after you confirm Luma's licence). Luma runs on DirectX 11.": "此游戏的 DLSS 调用来自 Luma，但 Luma 尚未设置。“修复”会同时设置 OptiScaler 和 Luma（在确认 Luma 许可证之后）。Luma 运行于 DirectX 11。",
  "Luma has a better mod for this game": "Luma 有此游戏更好的模组",
  "Switch the game to DirectX 11 for Luma": "为 Luma 将游戏切换到 DirectX 11",
  "Luma not set up yet": "Luma 尚未设置",
  "Press Fix it (sets up Luma)": "点击“修复”（设置 Luma）",
  "In the game: pick DirectX 11": "游戏中：选择 DirectX 11",
  "Press Fix it (switches to Luma)": "点击“修复”（切换到 Luma）",
  "In the game's graphics settings: DirectX 11": "在游戏图形设置中：DirectX 11",
  "Switch to Luma": "切换到 Luma",
  "Send game failure": "发送游戏故障",
  "GitHub opened with the report filled in. Drag the zip from the folder that opened onto it, then press Submit.": "已打开填好报告的 GitHub 页面。把打开的文件夹中的 zip 拖进去，然后点击 Submit。",
  "GitHub opened with the report filled in, and the log zip is copied. Click at the end of the report on GitHub, press Ctrl+V to attach the zip, then press Submit.": "GitHub 已打开并填好报告，日志 zip 已复制。在 GitHub 上点击报告末尾，按 Ctrl+V 附加 zip，然后点 Submit。",
  "Sign in once: on the GitHub page that opened, enter this code (it is already copied):": "只需登录一次：在打开的 GitHub 页面中输入此代码（已复制）：",
  "GitHub sign-in failed: {error}": "GitHub 登录失败：{error}",
  "Sending…": "正在发送…",
  "Check what will be sent": "检查将要发送的内容",
  "This is everything that leaves your PC, exactly as it will appear on GitHub. The issue and the logs are public. Your Windows user name, home folder and PC name are already hidden; game saves and other files are not included.": "这是离开你电脑的全部内容，与在 GitHub 上显示的完全一致。Issue 和日志是公开的。你的 Windows 用户名、主文件夹和电脑名称已被隐藏；不包含游戏存档和其他文件。",
  "Issue title": "Issue 标题",
