  "Sent as issue #{number}. The maintainer will reply there.": "已作为 issue #{number} 发送。维护者会在那里回复。",
  "Open it": "打开",

  // The pop-out DLSS 5 panel, and the DLSS 5 rows it shares with the Edit dialog.
  "Close (the hotkey reopens it)": "关闭（快捷键可再次打开）",
  "Everything back to default": "全部恢复默认",
  "Could not save: {error}": "无法保存：{error}",
  "Saved. A running game picks it up within a second.": "已保存。运行中的游戏会在一秒内生效。",
