  "Could not read the settings: {error}": "无法读取设置：{error}",
  "Editing the 64-bit helper this 32-bit game uses.": "正在编辑这款 32 位游戏所使用的 64 位辅助程序。",
  "Game is running. Changes land within a second.": "游戏正在运行。更改会在一秒内生效。",
