  "This game is switched to Deep Fried Chicken, so OptiScaler is not in the folder on purpose. Chicken last reported {state} (ARMED means it is running).": "此游戏已切换到 Deep Fried Chicken，所以文件夹里没有 OptiScaler 是正常的。Chicken 最近报告的状态是 {state}（ARMED 表示正在运行）。",
  "This game is switched to Deep Fried Chicken, so OptiScaler is not in the folder on purpose. Chicken has not written a log yet: launch the game, press Home and open its tab.": "此游戏已切换到 Deep Fried Chicken，所以文件夹里没有 OptiScaler 是正常的。Chicken 还没有写日志：启动游戏，按 Home 并打开它的标签页。",
  "Press Home and open the Deep Fried Chicken tab": "按 Home 并打开 Deep Fried Chicken 标签页",
  "Deep Fried Chicken: {state}": "Deep Fried Chicken：{state}",
  "Deep Fried Chicken runs the neural pass here": "这里由 Deep Fried Chicken 执行神经渲染",
  "Neural pass: Deep Fried Chicken — switch back to DLSS 5": "神经渲染：Deep Fried Chicken — 切回 DLSS 5",
